#!/bin/sh
# Arcadia OS — quick-start summary of what's installed and how to use it.

cat <<'EOF'

  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   ARCADIA OS — Gaming Edition
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  PREINSTALLED
    Steam .......... launch and log in; Proton handles Windows games
    Lutris ......... GOG / Epic / Humble / emulators / custom installs
    Wine + winetricks
    RetroArch, Dolphin, Mupen64Plus (+ PCSX2/PPSSPP if available)
    OBS Studio ..... recording & streaming
    Discord, Heroic, Bottles (Flatpak)

  PERFORMANCE
    GameMode ....... automatic; or run:  gamemoderun <game>
    MangoHud ....... overlay; run:       mangohud <game>
                     toggle in-game with Right-Shift + F12
    Gamescope ...... e.g.  gamescope -W 1920 -H 1080 -f -- <game>

  HELPERS
    arcadia-install-extras   install more launchers / emulators
    arcadia-nvidia           install proprietary NVIDIA drivers

  TIP: In Steam, enable Proton for all titles under
       Settings → Compatibility → "Enable Steam Play for all other titles".

EOF
